  "body": "### Summary\nApp test `VideoPlayerSheetTests.theWebViewSendsTheRefererOnTheWireForYouTubeOnly()` (from #761) failed after 191 s on CI job 130505752337, on PR #795, which changes no app code. It looks like a timing or wire-capture flake, not a regression.\n\n### Scope\n- Reproduce on the Mac: run that test in a loop (20 runs) on the iPhone 18 Pro simulator (iOS 27.0) and record how often it fails and how long each run takes.\n- Find what the test waits for and why it can take 191 s. Make it deterministic: a local server or loopback, an explicit timeout, no dependency on the real YouTube.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] 20 consecutive passes in CI or on the Mac, each run under 30 s.\n- [ ] The test still fails if the Referer is sent to a host other than YouTube.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
