   "body": "Second case, same suite: `VideoPlayerSheetTests.aPlayerThatAnswers401ReportsItAndAHealthyOneDoesNot()` failed after 267 s on #788 (job 130609097704). That PR changes no player code. In the same run `theWebViewSendsTheRefererOnTheWireForYouTubeOnly` passed, but took 223 s. The whole `VideoPlayerSheetTests` suite looks timing-bound; `StaticPageTests.theWebViewRunsNoPageScript` also took 462 s. Scope: every test of this suite.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
