   "body": "/claim cloud/i801-opus\n\nThe operator made unblocking the App CI job the top priority (2026-11-12): the cloud takes the test-code fix; the Mac only measures if needed (`host: mac` kept for that).\n\nPlan:\n- Read the failing jobs' logs (130925974296, 130925765092, 130784803961) against green dev-swift runs (43060241312, 43057139923) and find what each test waits on, and why the job can hang for 4 h (a continuation never resumed, or a main-actor deadlock).\n- Replace fixed sleeps and long polling loops with event waits (navigation finished, message handler, delegate continuation) bounded by a fail-fast timeout; share one warmed-up web view process where the test's claim allows it. No skip, no loosened assertion (#368).\n- Add a `timeout-minutes` to the simulator test step so a hang becomes a fast red; draft PR `fix/801-webview-tests`, Fable 5.2 adversarial review.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
